1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,410
The Monomyth Mayhem! Cut your trauma into little pieces and shuffle them!

2
00:00:08,181 --> 00:00:17,617
Welcome to The Ordinary World stasis loop: nothing changes; Dysfunction is habit. Normalize pain – feels like home.

3
00:00:19,617 --> 00:00:24,701
The Call to Adventure, Cognitive Dissonance: universe doesn't knock. Throws brick.

4
00:00:24,721 --> 00:00:32,120
You know Refusal of the Call, Rational Panic: too busy to save world. Ego fights to stay small.

5
00:00:33,397 --> 00:00:39,011
Meeting the Mentor, External Hard Drive: wisdom useless unless you give it away. Map, not legs.

6
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:47,353
Remember Crossing the Threshold: hand new cards, old self dead. Fear becomes movement. You can't un-fluff the pill.

7
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:52,475
Belly of the Whale, Digestion: no longer who you were, not yet who you'll become.

8
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:59,512
Anyway, Road of Trials grindset: recovery is practice; hero who survives not same animal.

9
00:01:00,209 --> 00:01:03,733
Meeting the Goddess, Self-Love Bomb: fully seen. Bliss valid game state.

10
00:01:04,387 --> 00:01:08,317
Woman as Temptress, Regression Pull: familiar cage feels safer than unfamiliar freedom.

11
00:01:08,534 --> 00:01:12,193
Atonement with the Father, Daddy Issues: kill internal should, claim own values.

12
00:01:12,568 --> 00:01:16,368
Not a metaphor: Apotheosis. Ego Death. Caterpillar liquid, butterfly inevitable.

13
00:01:16,388 --> 00:01:22,639
Ever tasted The Ultimate Boon, the Elixir? Not object; internal transformation, externalized.

14
00:01:23,233 --> 00:01:27,939
Refusal of the Return, Stay in Narnia: they stay in magic. Old life feels too small.

15
00:01:28,837 --> 00:01:32,752
The Magic Flight, Escape Velocity: keep Boon, or lose it on way home.

16
00:01:33,454 --> 00:01:38,134
You played Rescue from Without, Intervention: can't do it alone. Independence is trauma response.

17
00:01:38,734 --> 00:01:42,657
Crossing the Return Threshold, Re-Entry Shock: hardest stage. Gift must be shared to be kept.

18
00:01:43,056 --> 00:01:49,004
Master of Two Worlds, Code Switch: no split between spiritual and mundane. You are amphibious.

19
00:01:49,024 --> 00:01:53,428
Have you heard of Freedom to Live, Zen Mode? Cannot lose. Just vibe.

20
00:01:53,448 --> 00:01:57,348
The Anti-Journey, Tragedy of Stagnation: nothing happens. Fear winning.

21
00:01:57,368 --> 00:02:03,350
The Circular Journey, Eternal Recurrence: same story over, different adjectives. Up. Or down. But definitely around.

22
00:02:03,370 --> 00:02:09,200
Do you know The Hero, Main Character Energy? Ego vehicle. Often confused, usually reluctant.

23
00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:14,257
Let me tell you about The Shadow, Projection: dark mirror. Part of you that you locked in basement.

24
00:02:14,937 --> 00:02:18,457
The Shapeshifter, Trust Issues: loyalty ambiguous. Love or trap?

25
00:02:19,077 --> 00:02:24,059
The Herald, Wake Up Call: Quest ends, new one starts instantly. Annoying, but necessary.

26
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:29,578
This one has a rule: Threshold Guardian gatekeeping. Can't get past doorman, can't face boss.

27
00:02:30,019 --> 00:02:34,523
The thing about The Trickster, Chaos Agent: swap hands of two players. Truth through absurdity.

28
00:02:34,824 --> 00:02:38,764
The Ally, Emotional Support: you need Samwise. Someone to carry load when you can't.

29
00:02:38,966 --> 00:02:42,177
The Failed Journey, the Bad Ending: no one gets Boon. Trauma can win.

30
00:02:42,863 --> 00:02:47,033
Quest Die pressure cooker: if it tips, scream Kayfa-BOOM! Reality breaks.

31
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:51,957
No wait, Blödsinn! Nonsense check: pause, clarify, fix plot hole. Reset button.

32
00:02:52,742 --> 00:02:57,587
Everyone agrees: Kayfabe. Suspension of Disbelief. Treat lie as truth; we are all working gimmick.

33
00:02:58,327 --> 00:03:02,548
I once met Uncle FrizzleBob, the Author: I didn't finish this game. That part's yours.

34
00:03:02,908 --> 00:03:07,099
Mood — Fearful, Paralysis: cave you fear to enter holds treasure.

35
00:03:07,701 --> 00:03:12,679
The deck insists on Mood — Reckless, Leeroy Jenkins: play first card you touch, no thinking allowed.

36
00:03:13,099 --> 00:03:16,720
Mood — Grieving, Heavy Heart: loss is price of love. Only way out is through.

37
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:20,955
Mood — Manic zoomies: speak twice as fast. Energy without direction, brilliant disaster.

38
00:03:21,156 --> 00:03:25,075
Engineering, Structure: if it's stupid but works, still stupid, but at least it works.

39
00:03:26,005 --> 00:03:29,908
Did you ever try Swordplay, Cut? Sometimes Gordian Knot just needs sharp edge.

40
00:03:30,393 --> 00:03:34,149
Diplomacy, Chill: telling someone to go to hell in such a way they ask for directions.

41
00:03:34,754 --> 00:03:39,699
You with the card in your hand, Thievery, Yoink: steal card. Property is theft. Theft also theft.

42
00:03:40,062 --> 00:03:43,169
Timeline Shift retcon: undo last turn. Never happened. Past fluid.

43
00:03:43,451 --> 00:03:46,966
The Tenth Art, Edit: reality is draft. Feel free to mark it up.

44
00:03:47,107 --> 00:03:52,398
Meanwhile elsewhere, Multiverse, Parallel Play: why settle for one disaster when you can have infinite disasters?

45
00:03:52,801 --> 00:03:58,018
Fractal Narrative, Zoom In: card inside another card. Every story contains smaller story waiting to get out.

46
00:03:58,401 --> 00:04:02,245
The Sword, Decisive Action: resolves conflict violently. Use it to cut cord.

47
00:04:02,912 --> 00:04:06,747
You know the thing with The Mirror, Reflection: self-knowledge, most dangerous weapon of all.

48
00:04:06,767 --> 00:04:11,066
Which brings us to The Key, Access: opens doors. Also opens wounds. Be careful.

49
00:04:11,288 --> 00:04:14,364
The Compass, Direction: doesn't tell you where to go, only where you are.

50
00:04:14,688 --> 00:04:18,042
King Kayfabian, the Judge: your word is law. Someone has to wear crown.

51
00:04:18,586 --> 00:04:22,886
Nobody warned us about The Black Helicopter, Game Over: they found us. Scramble data.

52
00:04:23,546 --> 00:04:40,906
Stay Fluffy!
